{"1":{"w":[{"c":"اقْتَرَبَتِ","d":"iq'tarabati","e":"Has come near"},{"c":"السَّاعَةُ","d":"l-sāʿatu","e":"the Hour"},{"c":"وَانْشَقَّ","d":"wa-inshaqqa","e":"and has split"},{"c":"الْقَمَرُ","d":"l-qamaru","e":"the moon"}],"a":{"g":"The Hour has come near, and the moon has split [in two]."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"And if"},{"c":"يَرَوْا","d":"yaraw","e":"they see"},{"c":"ءَايَةً","d":"āyatan","e":"a Sign"},{"c":"يُعْرِضُوا","d":"yuʿ'riḍū","e":"they turn away"},{"c":"وَيَقُولُوا","d":"wayaqūlū","e":"and say"},{"c":"سِحْرٌ","d":"siḥ'run","e":"Magic"},{"c":"مُسْتَمِرٌّ","d":"mus'tamirrun","e":"continuing"}],"a":{"g":"And if they see a miracle, they turn away and say, \"Passing magic.\""}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَكَذَّبُوا","d":"wakadhabū","e":"And they denied"},{"c":"وَاتَّبَعُوا","d":"wa-ittabaʿū","e":"and followed"},{"c":"أَهْوَاءَهُمْ","d":"ahwāahum","e":"their desires"},{"c":"وَكُلُّ","d":"wakullu","e":"but (for) every"},{"c":"أَمْرٍ","d":"amrin","e":"matter"},{"c":"مُسْتَقِرٌّ","d":"mus'taqirrun","e":"(will be a) settlement"}],"a":{"g":"And they denied and followed their inclinations. But for every matter is a [time of] settlement."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"جَاءَهُمْ","d":"jāahum","e":"has come to them"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْأَنْبَاءِ","d":"l-anbāi","e":"the information"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"wherein"},{"c":"فِيهِ","d":"fīhi","e":"wherein"},{"c":"مُزْدَجَرٌ","d":"muz'dajarun","e":"(is) deterrence"}],"a":{"g":"And there has already come to them of information that in which there is deterrence -"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"حِكْمَةٌ","d":"ḥik'matun","e":"Wisdom"},{"c":"بَالِغَةٌ","d":"bālighatun","e":"perfect"},{"c":"فَمَا","d":"famā","e":"but not"},{"c":"تُغْنِ","d":"tugh'ni","e":"will avail"},{"c":"النُّذُرُ","d":"l-nudhuru","e":"the warnings"}],"a":{"g":"Extensive wisdom - but warning does not avail [them]."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"فَتَوَلَّ","d":"fatawalla","e":"So turn away"},{"c":"عَنْهُمْ","d":"ʿanhum","e":"from them"},{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يَدْعُ","d":"yadʿu","e":"will call"},{"c":"الدَّاعِ","d":"l-dāʿi","e":"the caller"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"a thing"},{"c":"نُكُرٍ","d":"nukurin","e":"terrible"}],"a":{"g":"So leave them, [O Muhammad]. The Day the Caller calls to something forbidding,"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"خُشَّعًا","d":"khushaʿan","e":"(Will be) humbled"},{"c":"أَبْصَارُهُمْ","d":"abṣāruhum","e":"their eyes"},{"c":"يَخْرُجُونَ","d":"yakhrujūna","e":"they will come forth"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"from"},{"c":"الْأَجْدَاثِ","d":"l-ajdāthi","e":"the graves"},{"c":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","d":"ka-annahum","e":"as if they (were)"},{"c":"جَرَادٌ","d":"jarādun","e":"locusts"},{"c":"مُنْتَشِرٌ","d":"muntashirun","e":"spreading"}],"a":{"g":"Their eyes humbled, they will emerge from the graves as if they were locusts spreading,"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"مُهْطِعِينَ","d":"muh'ṭiʿīna","e":"Racing ahead"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"toward"},{"c":"الدَّاعِ","d":"l-dāʿi","e":"the caller"},{"c":"يَقُولُ","d":"yaqūlu","e":"Will say"},{"c":"الْكَافِرُونَ","d":"l-kāfirūna","e":"the disbelievers"},{"c":"هَذَا","d":"hādhā","e":"This"},{"c":"يَوْمٌ","d":"yawmun","e":"(is) a Day"},{"c":"عَسِرٌ","d":"ʿasirun","e":"difficult"}],"a":{"g":"Racing ahead toward the Caller. The disbelievers will say, \"This is a difficult Day.\""}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَّبَتْ","d":"kadhabat","e":"Denied"},{"c":"قَبْلَهُمْ","d":"qablahum","e":"before them"},{"c":"قَوْمُ","d":"qawmu","e":"(the) people"},{"c":"نُوحٍ","d":"nūḥin","e":"(of) Nuh"},{"c":"فَكَذَّبُوا","d":"fakadhabū","e":"and they denied"},{"c":"عَبْدَنَا","d":"ʿabdanā","e":"Our slave"},{"c":"وَقَالُوا","d":"waqālū","e":"and said"},{"c":"مَجْنُونٌ","d":"majnūnun","e":"A madman"},{"c":"وَازْدُجِرَ","d":"wa-uz'dujira","e":"and he was repelled"}],"a":{"g":"The people of Noah denied before them, and they denied Our servant and said, \"A madman,\" and he was repelled."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"فَدَعَا","d":"fadaʿā","e":"So he called"},{"c":"رَبَّهُ","d":"rabbahu","e":"his Lord"},{"c":"أَنِّي","d":"annī","e":"I am"},{"c":"مَغْلُوبٌ","d":"maghlūbun","e":"one overpowered"},{"c":"فَانْتَصِرْ","d":"fa-intaṣir","e":"so help"}],"a":{"g":"So he invoked his Lord, \"Indeed, I am overpowered, so help.\""}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"فَفَتَحْنَا","d":"fafataḥnā","e":"So We opened"},{"c":"أَبْوَابَ","d":"abwāba","e":"(the) gates"},{"c":"السَّمَاءِ","d":"l-samāi","e":"(of) heaven"},{"c":"بِمَاءٍ","d":"bimāin","e":"with water"},{"c":"مُنْهَمِرٍ","d":"mun'hamirin","e":"pouring down"}],"a":{"g":"Then We opened the gates of the heaven with rain pouring down"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"وَفَجَّرْنَا","d":"wafajjarnā","e":"And We caused to burst"},{"c":"الْأَرْضَ","d":"l-arḍa","e":"the earth"},{"c":"عُيُونًا","d":"ʿuyūnan","e":"(with) springs"},{"c":"فَالْتَقَى","d":"fal-taqā","e":"so met"},{"c":"الْمَاءُ","d":"l-māu","e":"the water(s)"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"for"},{"c":"أَمْرٍ","d":"amrin","e":"a matter"},{"c":"قَدْ","d":"qad","e":"already"},{"c":"قُدِرَ","d":"qudira","e":"predestined"}],"a":{"g":"And caused the earth to burst with springs, and the waters met for a matter already predestined."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"وَحَمَلْنَاهُ","d":"waḥamalnāhu","e":"And We carried him"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"ذَاتِ","d":"dhāti","e":"(ark) made of planks"},{"c":"أَلْوَاحٍ","d":"alwāḥin","e":"(ark) made of planks"},{"c":"وَدُسُرٍ","d":"wadusurin","e":"and nails"}],"a":{"g":"And We carried him on a [construction of] planks and nails,"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"تَجْرِي","d":"tajrī","e":"Sailing"},{"c":"بِأَعْيُنِنَا","d":"bi-aʿyuninā","e":"before Our eyes"},{"c":"جَزَاءً","d":"jazāan","e":"a reward"},{"c":"لِمَنْ","d":"liman","e":"for (he) who"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"كُفِرَ","d":"kufira","e":"denied"}],"a":{"g":"Sailing under Our observation as reward for he who had been denied."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"تَرَكْنَاهَا","d":"taraknāhā","e":"We left it"},{"c":"ءَايَةً","d":"āyatan","e":"(as) a Sign"},{"c":"فَهَلْ","d":"fahal","e":"so is (there)"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مُدَّكِرٍ","d":"muddakirin","e":"who will receive admonition"}],"a":{"g":"And We left it as a sign, so is there any who will remember?"}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"فَكَيْفَ","d":"fakayfa","e":"So how"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"عَذَابِي","d":"ʿadhābī","e":"My punishment"},{"c":"وَنُذُرِ","d":"wanudhuri","e":"and My warnings"}],"a":{"g":"And how [severe] were My punishment and warning."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"يَسَّرْنَا","d":"yassarnā","e":"We have made easy"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانَ","d":"l-qur'āna","e":"the Quran"},{"c":"لِلذِّكْرِ","d":"lildhik'ri","e":"for remembrance"},{"c":"فَهَلْ","d":"fahal","e":"so is (there)"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مُدَّكِرٍ","d":"muddakirin","e":"who will receive admonition"}],"a":{"g":"And We have certainly made the Qur'an easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember?"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَّبَتْ","d":"kadhabat","e":"Denied"},{"c":"عَادٌ","d":"ʿādun","e":"Aad"},{"c":"فَكَيْفَ","d":"fakayfa","e":"so how"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"عَذَابِي","d":"ʿadhābī","e":"My punishment"},{"c":"وَنُذُرِ","d":"wanudhuri","e":"and My warnings"}],"a":{"g":"'Aad denied; and how [severe] were My punishment and warning."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"[We] sent"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"upon them"},{"c":"رِيحًا","d":"rīḥan","e":"a wind"},{"c":"صَرْصَرًا","d":"ṣarṣaran","e":"furious"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"on"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"a day"},{"c":"نَحْسٍ","d":"naḥsin","e":"(of) misfortune"},{"c":"مُسْتَمِرٍّ","d":"mus'tamirrin","e":"continuous"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We sent upon them a screaming wind on a day of continuous misfortune,"}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"تَنْزِعُ","d":"tanziʿu","e":"Plucking out"},{"c":"النَّاسَ","d":"l-nāsa","e":"men"},{"c":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","d":"ka-annahum","e":"as if they (were)"},{"c":"أَعْجَازُ","d":"aʿjāzu","e":"trunks"},{"c":"نَخْلٍ","d":"nakhlin","e":"(of) date-palms"},{"c":"مُنْقَعِرٍ","d":"munqaʿirin","e":"uprooted"}],"a":{"g":"Extracting the people as if they were trunks of palm trees uprooted."}},"21":{"w":[{"c":"فَكَيْفَ","d":"fakayfa","e":"So how"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"عَذَابِي","d":"ʿadhābī","e":"My punishment"},{"c":"وَنُذُرِ","d":"wanudhuri","e":"and My warnings"}],"a":{"g":"And how [severe] were My punishment and warning."}},"22":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"يَسَّرْنَا","d":"yassarnā","e":"We have made easy"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانَ","d":"l-qur'āna","e":"the Quran"},{"c":"لِلذِّكْرِ","d":"lildhik'ri","e":"for remembrance"},{"c":"فَهَلْ","d":"fahal","e":"so is (there)"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مُدَّكِرٍ","d":"muddakirin","e":"who will receive admonition"}],"a":{"g":"And We have certainly made the Qur'an easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember?"}},"23":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَّبَتْ","d":"kadhabat","e":"Denied"},{"c":"ثَمُودُ","d":"thamūdu","e":"Thamud"},{"c":"بِالنُّذُرِ","d":"bil-nudhuri","e":"the warnings"}],"a":{"g":"Thamud denied the warning"}},"24":{"w":[{"c":"فَقَالُوا","d":"faqālū","e":"And said"},{"c":"أَبَشَرًا","d":"abasharan","e":"Is (it) a human being"},{"c":"مِنَّا","d":"minnā","e":"among us"},{"c":"وَاحِدًا","d":"wāḥidan","e":"one"},{"c":"نَتَّبِعُهُ","d":"nattabiʿuhu","e":"(that) we should follow him"},{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed we"},{"c":"إِذًا","d":"idhan","e":"then"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"(will be) surely in"},{"c":"ضَلَالٍ","d":"ḍalālin","e":"error"},{"c":"وَسُعُرٍ","d":"wasuʿurin","e":"and madness"}],"a":{"g":"And said, \"Is it one human being among us that we should follow? Indeed, we would then be in error and madness."}},"25":{"w":[{"c":"أَءُلْقِيَ","d":"a-ul'qiya","e":"Has been sent"},{"c":"الذِّكْرُ","d":"l-dhik'ru","e":"the Reminder"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"to him"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"بَيْنِنَا","d":"bayninā","e":"among us"},{"c":"بَلْ","d":"bal","e":"Nay"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"he"},{"c":"كَذَّابٌ","d":"kadhābun","e":"(is) a liar"},{"c":"أَشِرٌ","d":"ashirun","e":"insolent"}],"a":{"g":"Has the message been sent down upon him from among us? Rather, he is an insolent liar.\""}},"26":{"w":[{"c":"سَيَعْلَمُونَ","d":"sayaʿlamūna","e":"They will know"},{"c":"غَدًا","d":"ghadan","e":"tomorrow"},{"c":"مَنِ","d":"mani","e":"who"},{"c":"الْكَذَّابُ","d":"l-kadhābu","e":"(is) the liar"},{"c":"الْأَشِرُ","d":"l-ashiru","e":"the insolent one"}],"a":{"g":"They will know tomorrow who is the insolent liar."}},"27":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"مُرْسِلُوا","d":"mur'silū","e":"(are) sending"},{"c":"النَّاقَةِ","d":"l-nāqati","e":"the she-camel"},{"c":"فِتْنَةً","d":"fit'natan","e":"(as) a trial"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"for them"},{"c":"فَارْتَقِبْهُمْ","d":"fa-ir'taqib'hum","e":"so watch them"},{"c":"وَاصْطَبِرْ","d":"wa-iṣ'ṭabir","e":"and be patient"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We are sending the she-camel as trial for them, so watch them and be patient."}},"28":{"w":[{"c":"وَنَبِّئْهُمْ","d":"wanabbi'hum","e":"And inform them"},{"c":"أَنَّ","d":"anna","e":"that"},{"c":"الْمَاءَ","d":"l-māa","e":"the water"},{"c":"قِسْمَةٌ","d":"qis'matun","e":"(is) to be shared"},{"c":"بَيْنَهُمْ","d":"baynahum","e":"between them"},{"c":"كُلُّ","d":"kullu","e":"each"},{"c":"شِرْبٍ","d":"shir'bin","e":"drink"},{"c":"مُحْتَضَرٌ","d":"muḥ'taḍarun","e":"attended"}],"a":{"g":"And inform them that the water is shared between them, each [day of] drink attended [by turn]."}},"29":{"w":[{"c":"فَنَادَوْا","d":"fanādaw","e":"But they called"},{"c":"صَاحِبَهُمْ","d":"ṣāḥibahum","e":"their companion"},{"c":"فَتَعَاطَى","d":"fataʿāṭā","e":"and he took"},{"c":"فَعَقَرَ","d":"faʿaqara","e":"and hamstrung"}],"a":{"g":"But they called their companion, and he dared and hamstrung [her]."}},"30":{"w":[{"c":"فَكَيْفَ","d":"fakayfa","e":"So how"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"was"},{"c":"عَذَابِي","d":"ʿadhābī","e":"My punishment"},{"c":"وَنُذُرِ","d":"wanudhuri","e":"and My warnings"}],"a":{"g":"And how [severe] were My punishment and warning."}},"31":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"[We] sent"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"upon them"},{"c":"صَيْحَةً","d":"ṣayḥatan","e":"thunderous blast"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةً","d":"wāḥidatan","e":"single"},{"c":"فَكَانُوا","d":"fakānū","e":"and they became"},{"c":"كَهَشِيمِ","d":"kahashīmi","e":"like dry twig fragments"},{"c":"الْمُحْتَظِرِ","d":"l-muḥ'taẓiri","e":"(used by) a fence builder"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We sent upon them one blast from the sky, and they became like the dry twig fragments of an [animal] pen."}},"32":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"يَسَّرْنَا","d":"yassarnā","e":"We have made easy"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانَ","d":"l-qur'āna","e":"the Quran"},{"c":"لِلذِّكْرِ","d":"lildhik'ri","e":"for remembrance"},{"c":"فَهَلْ","d":"fahal","e":"so is (there)"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مُدَّكِرٍ","d":"muddakirin","e":"who will receive admonition"}],"a":{"g":"And We have certainly made the Qur'an easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember?"}},"33":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَّبَتْ","d":"kadhabat","e":"Denied"},{"c":"قَوْمُ","d":"qawmu","e":"(the) people"},{"c":"لُوطٍ","d":"lūṭin","e":"(of) Lut"},{"c":"بِالنُّذُرِ","d":"bil-nudhuri","e":"the warnings"}],"a":{"g":"The people of Lot denied the warning."}},"34":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"[We] sent"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"upon them"},{"c":"حَاصِبًا","d":"ḥāṣiban","e":"a storm of stones"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"ءَالَ","d":"āla","e":"(the) family"},{"c":"لُوطٍ","d":"lūṭin","e":"(of) Lut"},{"c":"نَجَّيْنَاهُمْ","d":"najjaynāhum","e":"We saved them"},{"c":"بِسَحَرٍ","d":"bisaḥarin","e":"by dawn"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We sent upon them a storm of stones, except the family of Lot - We saved them before dawn"}},"35":{"w":[{"c":"نِعْمَةً","d":"niʿ'matan","e":"(As) a favor"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"عِنْدِنَا","d":"ʿindinā","e":"Us"},{"c":"كَذَلِكَ","d":"kadhālika","e":"Thus"},{"c":"نَجْزِي","d":"najzī","e":"We reward"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(one) who"},{"c":"شَكَرَ","d":"shakara","e":"(is) grateful"}],"a":{"g":"As favor from us. Thus do We reward he who is grateful."}},"36":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"أَنْذَرَهُمْ","d":"andharahum","e":"he warned them"},{"c":"بَطْشَتَنَا","d":"baṭshatanā","e":"(of) Our seizure"},{"c":"فَتَمَارَوْا","d":"fatamāraw","e":"but they disputed"},{"c":"بِالنُّذُرِ","d":"bil-nudhuri","e":"the warnings"}],"a":{"g":"And he had already warned them of Our assault, but they disputed the warning."}},"37":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"رَاوَدُوهُ","d":"rāwadūhu","e":"they demanded from him"},{"c":"عَنْ","d":"ʿan","e":"they demanded from him"},{"c":"ضَيْفِهِ","d":"ḍayfihi","e":"his guests"},{"c":"فَطَمَسْنَا","d":"faṭamasnā","e":"so We blinded"},{"c":"أَعْيُنَهُمْ","d":"aʿyunahum","e":"their eyes"},{"c":"فَذُوقُوا","d":"fadhūqū","e":"So taste"},{"c":"عَذَابِي","d":"ʿadhābī","e":"My punishment"},{"c":"وَنُذُرِ","d":"wanudhuri","e":"and My warnings"}],"a":{"g":"And they had demanded from him his guests, but We obliterated their eyes, [saying], \"Taste My punishment and warning.\""}},"38":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"صَبَّحَهُمْ","d":"ṣabbaḥahum","e":"seized them in the morning"},{"c":"بُكْرَةً","d":"buk'ratan","e":"early"},{"c":"عَذَابٌ","d":"ʿadhābun","e":"a punishment"},{"c":"مُسْتَقِرٌّ","d":"mus'taqirrun","e":"abiding"}],"a":{"g":"And there came upon them by morning an abiding punishment."}},"39":{"w":[{"c":"فَذُوقُوا","d":"fadhūqū","e":"So taste"},{"c":"عَذَابِي","d":"ʿadhābī","e":"My punishment"},{"c":"وَنُذُرِ","d":"wanudhuri","e":"and My warnings"}],"a":{"g":"So taste My punishment and warning."}},"40":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"يَسَّرْنَا","d":"yassarnā","e":"We have made easy"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانَ","d":"l-qur'āna","e":"the Quran"},{"c":"لِلذِّكْرِ","d":"lildhik'ri","e":"for remembrance"},{"c":"فَهَلْ","d":"fahal","e":"so is (there)"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مُدَّكِرٍ","d":"muddakirin","e":"who will receive admonition"}],"a":{"g":"And We have certainly made the Qur'an easy for remembrance, so is there any who will remember?"}},"41":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"جَاءَ","d":"jāa","e":"came"},{"c":"ءَالَ","d":"āla","e":"(to the) people"},{"c":"فِرْعَوْنَ","d":"fir'ʿawna","e":"(of) Firaun"},{"c":"النُّذُرُ","d":"l-nudhuru","e":"warnings"}],"a":{"g":"And there certainly came to the people of Pharaoh warning."}},"42":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَّبُوا","d":"kadhabū","e":"They denied"},{"c":"بِءَايَاتِنَا","d":"biāyātinā","e":"Our Signs"},{"c":"كُلِّهَا","d":"kullihā","e":"all of them"},{"c":"فَأَخَذْنَاهُمْ","d":"fa-akhadhnāhum","e":"so We seized them"},{"c":"أَخْذَ","d":"akhdha","e":"(with) a seizure"},{"c":"عَزِيزٍ","d":"ʿazīzin","e":"(of) All-Mighty"},{"c":"مُقْتَدِرٍ","d":"muq'tadirin","e":"(the) Powerful One"}],"a":{"g":"They denied Our signs, all of them, so We seized them with a seizure of one Exalted in Might and Perfect in Ability."}},"43":{"w":[{"c":"أَكُفَّارُكُمْ","d":"akuffārukum","e":"Are your disbelievers"},{"c":"خَيْرٌ","d":"khayrun","e":"better"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"than"},{"c":"أُولَئِكُمْ","d":"ulāikum","e":"those"},{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"or"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"بَرَاءَةٌ","d":"barāatun","e":"(is) an exemption"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الزُّبُرِ","d":"l-zuburi","e":"the Scriptures"}],"a":{"g":"Are your disbelievers better than those [former ones], or have you immunity in the scripture?"}},"44":{"w":[{"c":"أَمْ","d":"am","e":"Or"},{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"(do) they say"},{"c":"نَحْنُ","d":"naḥnu","e":"We"},{"c":"جَمِيعٌ","d":"jamīʿun","e":"(are) an assembly"},{"c":"مُنْتَصِرٌ","d":"muntaṣirun","e":"helping (each other)"}],"a":{"g":"Or do they say, \"We are an assembly supporting [each other]\"?"}},"45":{"w":[{"c":"سَيُهْزَمُ","d":"sayuh'zamu","e":"Soon will be defeated"},{"c":"الْجَمْعُ","d":"l-jamʿu","e":"(their) assembly"},{"c":"وَيُوَلُّونَ","d":"wayuwallūna","e":"and they will turn"},{"c":"الدُّبُرَ","d":"l-dubura","e":"(their) backs"}],"a":{"g":"[Their] assembly will be defeated, and they will turn their backs [in retreat]."}},"46":{"w":[{"c":"بَلِ","d":"bali","e":"Nay"},{"c":"السَّاعَةُ","d":"l-sāʿatu","e":"the Hour"},{"c":"مَوْعِدُهُمْ","d":"mawʿiduhum","e":"(is) their promised time"},{"c":"وَالسَّاعَةُ","d":"wal-sāʿatu","e":"and the Hour"},{"c":"أَدْهَى","d":"adhā","e":"(will be) more grievous"},{"c":"وَأَمَرُّ","d":"wa-amarru","e":"and more bitter"}],"a":{"g":"But the Hour is their appointment [for due punishment], and the Hour is more disastrous and more bitter."}},"47":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْمُجْرِمِينَ","d":"l-muj'rimīna","e":"the criminals"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(are) in"},{"c":"ضَلَالٍ","d":"ḍalālin","e":"an error"},{"c":"وَسُعُرٍ","d":"wasuʿurin","e":"and madness"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the criminals are in error and madness."}},"48":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"(The) Day"},{"c":"يُسْحَبُونَ","d":"yus'ḥabūna","e":"they will be dragged"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"into"},{"c":"النَّارِ","d":"l-nāri","e":"the Fire"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"on"},{"c":"وُجُوهِهِمْ","d":"wujūhihim","e":"their faces"},{"c":"ذُوقُوا","d":"dhūqū","e":"Taste"},{"c":"مَسَّ","d":"massa","e":"(the) touch"},{"c":"سَقَرَ","d":"saqara","e":"(of) Hell"}],"a":{"g":"The Day they are dragged into the Fire on their faces [it will be said], \"Taste the touch of Saqar.\""}},"49":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed [We]"},{"c":"كُلَّ","d":"kulla","e":"every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"خَلَقْنَاهُ","d":"khalaqnāhu","e":"We created it"},{"c":"بِقَدَرٍ","d":"biqadarin","e":"by a measure"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, all things We created with predestination."}},"50":{"w":[{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And not"},{"c":"أَمْرُنَا","d":"amrunā","e":"(is) Our Command"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"but"},{"c":"وَاحِدَةٌ","d":"wāḥidatun","e":"one"},{"c":"كَلَمْحٍ","d":"kalamḥin","e":"like the twinkling"},{"c":"بِالْبَصَرِ","d":"bil-baṣari","e":"(of) the eye"}],"a":{"g":"And Our command is but one, like a glance of the eye."}},"51":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَقَدْ","d":"walaqad","e":"And certainly"},{"c":"أَهْلَكْنَا","d":"ahlaknā","e":"We destroyed"},{"c":"أَشْيَاعَكُمْ","d":"ashyāʿakum","e":"your kinds"},{"c":"فَهَلْ","d":"fahal","e":"so is (there)"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"any"},{"c":"مُدَّكِرٍ","d":"muddakirin","e":"who will receive admonition"}],"a":{"g":"And We have already destroyed your kinds, so is there any who will remember?"}},"52":{"w":[{"c":"وَكُلُّ","d":"wakullu","e":"And every"},{"c":"شَيْءٍ","d":"shayin","e":"thing"},{"c":"فَعَلُوهُ","d":"faʿalūhu","e":"they did"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"الزُّبُرِ","d":"l-zuburi","e":"the written records"}],"a":{"g":"And everything they did is in written records."}},"53":{"w":[{"c":"وَكُلُّ","d":"wakullu","e":"And every"},{"c":"صَغِيرٍ","d":"ṣaghīrin","e":"small"},{"c":"وَكَبِيرٍ","d":"wakabīrin","e":"and big"},{"c":"مُسْتَطَرٌ","d":"mus'taṭarun","e":"(is) written down"}],"a":{"g":"And every small and great [thing] is inscribed."}},"54":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْمُتَّقِينَ","d":"l-mutaqīna","e":"the righteous"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(will be) in"},{"c":"جَنَّاتٍ","d":"jannātin","e":"gardens"},{"c":"وَنَهَرٍ","d":"wanaharin","e":"and river"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the righteous will be among gardens and rivers,"}},"55":{"w":[{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"In"},{"c":"مَقْعَدِ","d":"maqʿadi","e":"a seat"},{"c":"صِدْقٍ","d":"ṣid'qin","e":"(of) honor"},{"c":"عِنْدَ","d":"ʿinda","e":"near"},{"c":"مَلِيكٍ","d":"malīkin","e":"a King"},{"c":"مُقْتَدِرٍ","d":"muq'tadirin","e":"Most Powerful"}],"a":{"g":"In a seat of honor near a Sovereign, Perfect in Ability."}}}